Monkey Hop Clicker - setup
1) Ye poora folder GitHub repo (monkey-clicker) me upload karo (zip extract karke ya "Add file > Upload files").
2) Actions tab > "Build APK" > Run workflow. Khatam hone par Artifacts se MonkeyHopClicker-apk download karo.
3) Install karo. App kholo > 1) App info > 3 dots > Allow restricted settings.
4) 2) Accessibility settings > Downloaded apps > Monkey Hop Clicker > ON.
5) Game kholo, right side ke START button dabao. Rokne ke liye STOP.
